{
  "_comment": "Data for util/recabal/gen.py. Specification: doc/recabalization-brief.md Revisions 2 to 2.3, sections 3.1-3.5 and Appendix A, re-derived onto the release-devel-B0.1 line (upstream main d0ecddfd plus the Build-system PRs 1139, 1099, 1098, 1100). Components are listed in dependency order; every entry of depends names an earlier component. The module lists are placements: one without a source in this tree is skipped until its step of the line lands, and a source no placement names is placed automatically (gen.py, effective); expected_module_count counts the placements, not this tree's modules.",
  "expected_module_count": 250,
  "cabal_version": "3.14",
  "package_version": "2026.1",
  "license": "BSD-3-Clause",
  "tested_with": "GHC == 9.14.1",
