      {
        "name": "fstscopes",
        "main": "src/comp/fstscopes.hs"
      }
    ],
    "_programs_comment": "Programs whose entry module a later step of the line adds (bo2bloogle, tconcheck, fstcheck, fstscopes; src/comp/Makefile builds them from src/comp/<name>.hs) are listed here from the start and skipped while the module is absent; fstcheck and fstscopes link the libfst objects through the waveforms package."
